&lt;p&gt;At Algolia, we are passionate about helping developers &amp;amp; product teams connect their users with what matters most in milliseconds!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for highly driven individuals with strong technical aptitude and natural sales instincts to join our growing sales organization. As a Business Development Representative (BDR) at Algolia, you will play a critical role prospecting and expanding business opportunities for our Enterprise and Commercial teams. You will take part in a wide variety of responsibilities that will help foster, qualify, and mature our pipeline with high profile customers. We need someone with a hunter attitude who thrives in autonomy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role where your ideas matter! As a BDR, you will research your accounts, hone your craft in effective outreach, and have room to experiment with new ways of reaching prospects. Our team shares what works and what doesn’t, so you’ll grow quickly and help others do the same. We’re looking for a team player who welcomes feedback and is committed to continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;uil-fw-normal uil-ff-hind uil-fsz-16 lg:uil-fsz-18 uil-lh-bigger uil-color-grey-700&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE WILL CONSIST OF:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Enterprise or Commercial Account Executives&amp;nbsp; to strategize on how to approach targeted accounts and build global pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and prospect key contacts at target accounts, creating personalized outreach by understanding each prospect’s business, pain points, and use casesConduct high quality outbound across email, phone, and LinkedIn to build pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an active part of the team, sharing best practices and participating in the Sales Development organization&#39;s projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, track and report sales activities and results using SFDC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ months experience in outbound prospecting and pipeline generation (SaaS experience preferred, but not required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self starter mindset with a competitive drive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn and adapt to change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success overachieving (professionally/ personally)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an interest in the tech industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
