&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a problem solver, able to think outside the box and eager to nurture others and learn from them, then this is your challenge!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;principal engineer working across the entire frontend stack&lt;/strong&gt;, from design-system primitives to product-level architecture, you will shape how developers build with Algolia and how customers experience our products.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Frontend Experiences team, we&#39;re on a mission to make it effortless for developers to &lt;strong&gt;build great search and discovery experiences on the front end&lt;/strong&gt;, with libraries, components and tooling that are fast, accessible, and a pleasure to use. Our work reaches customers and their end users directly, on the web and on mobile, so the quality bar is high and the feedback loop is short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Right now, that includes a cross-team, multi-quarter effort to &lt;strong&gt;evolve the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt; from a collection of product surfaces into one coherent environment: a new navigation and information architecture, a shared component foundation, and an interaction model that supports traditional configuration, conversational assistance and agentic workflows side by side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is looking for an experienced individual who is well versed in defining, building and operating scalable architectures, with proven strengths in cross-team collaboration, taking solutions all the way through delivery to adoption by other engineering teams and by customers. You will play a pivotal role in architecting and implementing systems that play a central role across all of Algolia&#39;s front-end products, including libraries that run in production on thousands of customer sites. You will also play a role in training/mentoring and leading team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE WILL CONSIST OF:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defining the multi-year technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for Algolia&#39;s front-end platform, and turning it into roadmaps and projects that several teams can execute;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playing an active role in the evolution of the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt;: shaping the experience architecture, the component strategy and the technical foundations for conversational and agentic UX, and partnering with engineering, product and design leadership to sequence delivery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving convergence on a shared component library&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing duplicated components and inconsistent patterns across product surfaces;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing and delivering solutions&lt;/strong&gt; that will scale with significant volumes, be highly available, performant and resilient, including on pages and apps we do not control;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, taking them all the way through delivery to adoption by engineering teams and customers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping API design, versioning and backward-compatibility strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for public libraries used by a large developer community;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embodying technical expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, that the team can refer to for advice or validation of a solution;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setting engineering standards and best practices&lt;/strong&gt; to be followed by engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of setting technical direction across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a &lt;strong&gt;thought leader/standard-bearer&lt;/strong&gt; for engineers, inside and outside the company (talks, open source, writing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience &lt;strong&gt;leading engineers on large, cross-cutting projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience &lt;strong&gt;designing full stack solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, interacting with microservice architectures, and strong grounding beyond the frontend (APIs, backend services, delivery infrastructure) to make sound end-to-end trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep frontend expertise&lt;/strong&gt; (TypeScript, modern web platform, React and other major frameworks, accessibility, bundle size and runtime performance)&lt;/li&gt;
