&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;building complex, high traffic &amp;amp; multi products web applications&lt;/strong&gt; such as dashboards or admin consoles, and leading cross-team UI consolidation efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in &lt;strong&gt;conversational and agentic interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; (chat, streaming responses, tool-driven workflows) and in the architecture needed to support them&lt;/li&gt;
