&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on the Connectors Platform Team, you’ll play a key role in building products that help our customers ingest, transform, and enrich their data with AI, making it simple to integrate into Algolia.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team &amp;amp; Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Connectors Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt; builds and scales the services that bring our customers’ data into Algolia, reliably, securely, and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work touches:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-commerce:&lt;/strong&gt; powering real-time integrations with Shopify, Commercetools, BigCommerce&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Connectivity:&lt;/strong&gt; connecting to sources like JSON, BigQuery, Supabase, MySQL, and beyond&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Transformations: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;allow customers to transform their data as it flows into Algolia&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Enrichment Pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; enhancing data to improve search relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We run on Go, Kubernetes, and Google Cloud, with an engineering culture built around reliability, performance, and simplicity.&lt;/p&gt;
