&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and scale distributed data ingestion services serving thousands of global businesses&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements to system reliability, scalability and throughput&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion engineering excellence in testing, observability, and performance&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
